        "id": 17464,
        "title": "Declaración de retorno",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148195,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aprendamos cómo usar las declaraciones de retorno para salir de las funciones en cualquier momento que queramos, incluso en medio del código.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148196,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Hemos aprendido a usar <code>return</code> al final de una función para pasar un valor como salida.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"addScoreBonus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"score\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score + \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = addScoreBonus(\" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>return</code> seguido de <code>score + 10</code> y finalmente <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148197,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cualquier cosa después de una declaración <code>return</code> no se ejecuta. Aquí, la declaración de registro después de la declaración <code>return</code> no funciona en absoluto.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"51\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"addScoreBonus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"score\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score + \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;This won't run in the game loop&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = addScoreBonus(\" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>return score + 10;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148198,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Si tenemos múltiples declaraciones <code>return</code>, la que se ejecute primero saldrá de la función. Aquí, solo se devuelve la nueva puntuación.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"88\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"addScoreBonus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"score\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score + \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;This line doesn't execute&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = addScoreBonus(\" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>return</code> seguido de <code>\"This line doesn't execute\"</code> y finalmente <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148199,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Si usamos declaraciones condicionales, podemos usar <code>return</code> para detener una función en diferentes partes del código según la entrada.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"87\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getRespawnMessage\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"lives\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (lives &lt;= \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Game Over&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Respawn&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" message = getRespawnMessage(\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(message);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>return</code> seguido de <code>return</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148200,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Las declaraciones de retorno al final de la función y fuera de cualquier declaración condicional se ejecutan solo si no se ha cumplido ninguna condición.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"87\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getRespawnMessage\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"lives\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (lives &lt;= \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Game Over&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Respawn&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" message = getRespawnMessage(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(message);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>return</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148201,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos usar la última declaración de retorno para capturar el último caso posible. Aquí, si <code>health</code> está entre <code>1</code> y <code>99</code>, el jugador sigue vivo pero no está completo.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"128\" endIndex=\"134\" /><option startIndex=\"135\" endIndex=\"141\" /><option startIndex=\"141\" endIndex=\"142\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getHealthState\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (health &lt;= \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Dead&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (health &gt;= \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Full health&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hurt&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" state = getHealthState(\" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(state);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>return</code> seguido de <code>\"Hurt\"</code> y finalmente <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 148202,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Por qué usamos declaraciones <code>return</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Para devolver un valor de una función</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Para mostrar un valor en la consola</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Para devolver un valor de una función.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148203,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué sucede con las instrucciones colocadas después de una declaración de retorno?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Las instrucciones no se ejecutan ya que <code>return</code> detiene la función</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nada, las instrucciones se ejecutan normalmente</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Las instrucciones no se ejecutan ya que <code>return</code> detiene la función.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148204,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué declaración <code>return</code> se ejecuta en este código?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"addScoreBonus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"score\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score + \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;This line isn't executed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = addScoreBonus(\" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>return score + 10;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>return \"This line isn't executed\";</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>return score + 10;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
